  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19517/450x258/resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788984000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19517-buy-resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam/",
      "user": "DUNDI",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/6424429-1744558981.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This game was absolutely fantastic.\n\n\n\nThe combat system was really good while still being simple and easy to understand. The story was insanely good, the textures were beautifully detailed, and the action never lets you wait too long. The puzzles were great, and the music was honestly incredible — you can even see in the credits that more than 50 people worked on the sound alone, which is impressive for such a small game.\n\n\n\nThe main character never got boring. She felt authentic and well-written, and I genuinely cared about what was happening.\n\n\n\nOverall, I would give this game a solid 10/10. It’s been a long time since I played something that made me genuinely want to keep going just to find out what’s behind the next door.\n\n\n\nHighly recommended! :)"
    },
